  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Build, upload or aggregate fuzzy cognitive maps (FCMs), view them as weighted directed graphs, run iterative inference from a starting state until it settles, and learn FCM weights from tabular data with a Neural-FCM. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
